    "note": "The Oracle instruction creates an unmodified copy, then gives that token haste and establishes a source-independent next-end-step sacrifice. Unlike XMage CreateTokenCopyTargetEffect.setHasHaste, the later gained haste is not a copiable exception. The delayed sacrifice is not an intrinsic ability of the token and persists through ability loss; copied copies do not inherit either effect."
